      "id": "floe",
      "name": "floe",
      "category": "data",
      "color": "blue",
      "tagline": "Streaming lakehouse on Kubernetes, up with one command",
      "pitch": "Live Wikipedia edits flow through Redpanda, are validated against a data contract and land exactly once in Apache Iceberg on S3-compatible storage. dbt builds silver and gold behind a data-quality gate, and FastAPI serves the result. KEDA scales the processor on consumer lag, Prometheus and Grafana watch it, and CI deploys it all into kind.",
      "highlights": [
        "Exactly-once without trusting Kafka offsets: each batch's rows and Kafka offsets go into one Iceberg commit, with fencing against zombie replicas, so a SIGKILLed pod loses or duplicates nothing",
        "Helm chart with generated secrets, non-root read-only containers, NetworkPolicies, KEDA on lag, CronJob transforms and compaction; Trivy gates the image and chart in CI",
        "The dbt quality gate (17 tests) publishes gold only on a full pass, and it caught real duplicate events from overlapping producers during a rolling restart"
      ],
      "stats": [
        {
          "value": 30968,
          "label": "events/s end to end · 1.2M burst",
          "note": "KEDA 1→6 replicas · 1 pinned: 27,385/s"
        },
        {
          "value": 2.39,
          "decimals": 2,
          "suffix": " s",
          "label": "p95 produce → queryable in Iceberg",
          "note": "2,000 ev/s steady · p50 1.36 s"
        },
        {
          "value": 12.0,
          "decimals": 1,
          "suffix": " s",
          "label": "burst start → 6 replicas ready",
          "note": "first scale-out decision at 7.0 s"
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "label": "duplicates or losses after SIGKILL",
          "note": "180,000 rows verified · replacement Ready in 5.4 s"
        }
      ],
      "pipeline": [
        {
          "label": "Ingest",
          "sub": "Wikimedia SSE · Redpanda"
        },
        {
          "label": "Stream",
          "sub": "contract · exactly-once"
        },
        {
          "label": "Lake",
          "branches": [
            "Bronze",
            "DLQ"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Transform",
          "sub": "dbt + DuckDB · 17 tests"
        },
        {
          "label": "Serve",
          "sub": "gold Iceberg · FastAPI"
        }
      ],
