      "id": "aiwatch",
      "name": "aiwatch",
      "category": "security",
      "color": "amber",
      "tagline": "Find, fix and continuously monitor AI-stack vulnerabilities",
      "pitch": "Inventories an AI/LLM repo (ML dependencies, MCP servers, Hugging Face refs, model artifacts and risky loading code), matches it against live OSV.dev advisories and writes the fixes. A daily GitHub Action then reports what is new since yesterday, and why.",
      "highlights": [
        "Minimal safe version bumps, co-resolved with uv so the fixed set installs together, plus HF commit-SHA pins, weights_only=True, yaml.safe_load and pinned MCP servers",
        "SQLite baseline separates newly disclosed advisories from known ones and from drift (new risky code, config or dependencies)",
        "SARIF to code scanning, one tracking issue, HTML dashboard; OWASP LLM Top 10 2025 and MITRE ATLAS mappings"
      ],
      "stats": [
        {
          "value": 272,
          "label": "findings auto-fixed · demo app",
          "note": "257 advisories → 0 after aiwatch fix"
        },
        {
          "value": 129,
